tests {
  test("Kafka Connect accepted the resume (HTTP 202)", function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(202);
  });
}

docs {
  ## What this proves
  RESTORE for `A3`. Replication resumes from the committed binlog position; nothing is lost while paused.

  ## Captures
  Nothing.

  ## Consumes
  - `chaos_connector_name` from `A1`

  ## When it fails
  If this fails replication stays stopped. Send it again; do not leave the folder until `A8` is green.
}
